  <item>
    <title>EP 08 - 一起散步吧！在上海与东京之间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69842f46c78b823892c4fe18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69842f46c78b823892c4fe18</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Feb 2026 12:02:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期节目，我和景三第一次尝试用一种有点特别的方式录制——</span><br><span>我们没有坐在同一间录音室里，而是</span><strong><span>背靠背</span></strong><span>，分别在</span><strong><span>上海</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>东京</span></strong><span>的街头行走。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到两段不同城市里的声音：</span></p><span></span><p><span>一边，是我在上海街头边走边录下的漫谈。</span><br><span>从</span><strong><span>长宁、静安、徐汇，到老黄浦</span></strong><span>的街道深处，</span><br><span>那些属于</span><strong><span>80、90</span></strong><span>一代人的童年记忆、成长轨迹，</span><br><span>还有我们在城市里慢慢留下的生活痕迹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另一边，是景三沿着东京的</span><strong><span>JR与私铁线路</span></strong><span>展开的一次电车之旅。</span><br><span>从秋叶原到池袋，看看 </span><strong><span>OTAKU文化</span></strong><span>如何依附通勤线路生长；</span><br><span>再到下北泽与吉祥寺，感受私铁如何把</span><strong><span>二手文化、文艺气息与慢生活</span></strong><span>轻轻串联在一起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而在两段行走之后，</span><br><span>我们也终于回到同一间录音室，</span><br><span>重新坐下来，聊聊这趟关于</span><strong><span>两座城市、两种节奏</span></strong><span>的旅途。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期时间轴</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>上海</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> &nbsp;上海“小资文艺”的街头巡礼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> &nbsp;80后的上海童年</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> &nbsp;城区之间若有若无的“鄙视链”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> &nbsp;我的「黄浦情结」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> &nbsp;各区特色街道的个人推荐</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>东京</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">34:37</a> &nbsp;山手线电车之旅开始</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> &nbsp;什么是OTAKU文化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> &nbsp;秋叶原：圣地巡礼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> &nbsp;走进东京私铁之旅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a> &nbsp;世田谷线电车之旅</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>再回到两座城市之间</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3303">55:03</a> &nbsp;上海90年代电影《股疯》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> &nbsp;时代的记忆：沪西工人俱乐部</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3797">01:03:17</a> 东京的二手书文化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4280">01:11:20</a> 日本的搭讪文化观察</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4607">01:16:47</a> 东京的祈福寺庙</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>附：节目中提到的东京寺庙 / 神社</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>学业学问</span></strong><span>｜汤岛天满宫（文京区汤岛3-30）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>事业发展</span></strong><span>｜代代木八幡宫（代代木5-1-1）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>财运亨通</span></strong><span>｜小網神社（日本桥小網町16-23）</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>恋爱婚运</span></strong><span>｜东京大神宫（千代田区富士见2-4-1）</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
