    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 12:16:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天是一个奇妙的季节。也许这个夏天我们会有重逢、相遇或新的旅程，而音乐让这一切更为美妙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是松弛感墨鱼电台的第一期</span><strong><span>音乐特辑</span></strong><span>，由</span><strong><span>主播小言</span></strong><span>（言盐）和</span><strong><span>特辑嘉宾胖坤</span></strong><span>共同呈现，我们愿临时称我们俩为“空调间”与“自然风”组合（bushi，因为这个名字某种程度上反映了本期我们带来的音乐风格。在摇曳生姿和肆意驰骋之间寻找一个临界点，一切都在音乐里🎵。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧 本期音乐List：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👉片头</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Mission Completed——陈勋奇</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💁 胖坤推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>南海姑娘——王菲 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Isle Of Puleu Bali——潘迪华 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>蘇州夜曲——宗次郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>Never Again——青木カレン</span></p><span></span><p><span>悲しみのJODY (悲伤的乔迪)——山下達郎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✈️ 胖坤的夏日旅行</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTSwoeSMSK-_18NsKBqzi0DYExs.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuH-LGwMumIeogE5OAO6usOFbzco.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7CGqeyE6uF6j9J3N1OCkxB1i1A.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnqoSvhLO5lva9Z0lApqZ_rGd_q_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>💁 小言推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>静安碎碎念——PO8/喜辰晨</span></p><span></span><p><span>Gramma Ruth at the Grand Canyon, 1964——Elijah Fox</span></p><span></span><p><span>Brunch——Code</span></p><span></span><p><span>파도 (波浪)——新少年</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fun——Sun Room</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✈️小言的夏日旅行</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls7QuVv_ISyidGMMFuoqMAIMIcHO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJRJ0P1sZTKMkYRzyEzyF3N9DzF.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
