  <item>
    <title>EP 03 - 从坂本龙一到心灵鸡汤，九紫离火龙年的开年漫谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d07383513a776b57590755</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d07383513a776b57590755</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Feb 2024 08:51:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnIuObTQcm_L4-KxeHEcjvgqoQ4v.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>有一些瞬间，我们会被一些人启迪，唤醒自己的内心。</span></p><span></span><p><span>坂本龙一的音乐就是这样为我们带来灵感和感动的存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>距离教授的离开又过了一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些被他的音乐点亮的人，现在过得怎样了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在农历新年的第一期松弛感墨鱼电台，我和景三从教授的音乐聊到自己的人生感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>飞速变幻的世界里，新的一年，我们要如何自洽？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ryuichi Sakamoto - Blu (Tokyo Philharmonic Orchestra)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ryuichi Sakamoto - Rain</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravel Quartet in F Major Budapest String Quartet (1953⧸1958) LP - A4 – Vif Et Agité</span></p><span></span><p><span>矢野顕子 (Akiko Yano) - 日本少女 (Japanese Girl) (1976)</span></p><span></span><p><span>大貫妙子 - 若き日の望楼 (1980) Taeko Ohnuki</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ryuichi Sakamoto - ＂Life, Life＂ (from ＂async＂)</span></p><span></span><p><span>David Bowie &amp; Freddie Mercury - Under Pressure</span></p>]]></description>
